  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You glide through the water with deadly grace.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Swim-By Attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you make a melee attack as your standard action while using this feat, your movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity from the creature you attack. In addition, if you spend one use of your mythic power, you can move up to twice your swim speed in addition to your standard action, rather than being limited to your swim speed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
